/S /P
/E (The geopolitics of the AI race is shaping up to be one of the defining narratives of the 21st century, echoing the high-stakes tension and technological fervor reminiscent of the Cold War's Space Race and the Nuclear Power Development Race. Just as the launch of Sputnik in 1957 signaled a seismic shift in global power dynamics, the advent of advanced AI technologies is redrawing the boundaries of geopolitical influence. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
