/E (The US also convinced Japan and the Netherlands to tighten chip export restrictions to China in 2023, prompting China to retaliate by banning US-based semiconductor manufacturer Micron from key infrastructure projects and restricting exports of the critical chipmaking materials gallium and germanium. The US countered with further restrictions on chip sales to China, causing Nvidia's China revenues to drop 53%. )
